  "name": "VarSetter Overrides Expression Variable Regression",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Regression fixture for the lazy-realization race: an expression variable `s1` (source \"123\", evaluates to the string 123) is overwritten by a Variable Setter to the literal \"new value!\". A Delay holds the run open so any deferred realization push has time to land, and a downstream Log reads `s1`. Before the fix the setter read `s1` to branch on its shape, realizing the pending expression and firing a deferred variable_changed push of the OLD value 123 that raced and clobbered the setter's overwrite push, so the watched Current value reverted to 123. The fix supersedes the pending expression via a direct write WITHOUT realizing it.",
